<p>For every percent that your Psi pool exceeds <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">87%, 79%, 73%, 68%, 64%,</acronym> you gain 1% global speed (up to a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+12%, +20%, +26%, +31%, +35%</acronym>).</p><p>The first talent point invested will also increase the amount of Psi you gain from Willpower by 0.5, but reduce the amount of life you gain from Constitution by 0.25 and will increase your solipsism threshold by 10% (currently 0%). Exceptional focus on this talent can suppress your solipsism threshold.</p>